    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clubbed</strong> is a chaotic online party game inspired by mini-golf \u2014 where all players hit at the same time\u2026 on the same course. <strong>Collisions guaranteed!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No turn-based nonsense here: everyone plays simultaneously in a physics-based arena where <strong>skill and chaos go hand in hand</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge your friends across multiple game modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Golf Mode</strong> \u2013 Sink all the holes before your opponents<br>\ud83c\udfc3 <strong>Race Mode</strong> \u2013 Pass every checkpoint in order as fast as you can<br>\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Capture the Flag</strong> \u2013 Hold the flag to score points and win the match<br>\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Deathmatch Mode</strong> \u2013 Avoid traps and explosions, and outlast your opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Fun, dynamic ball physics<br>\ud83c\udfb1 A unique shot system inspired by croquet<br>\ud83e\udde2 Customize your ball with skins, hats, trails, sounds, and more<br>\ud83c\udf10 Online multiplayer for up to 12 players<br>\ud83c\udf81 <strong>Pick up offensive and defensive power-ups</strong> to cause chaos or protect yourself<br>\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Online leaderboards</strong> to compare your scores with the world (or just your friends)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking for quick fun with friends or fierce competition, <strong>Clubbed</strong> delivers <strong>fast-paced, unpredictable, and endlessly replayable matches</strong>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clubbed</strong> is a chaotic online party game inspired by mini-golf \u2014 where all players hit at the same time\u2026 on the same course. <strong>Collisions guaranteed!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No turn-based nonsense here: everyone plays simultaneously in a physics-based arena where <strong>skill and chaos go hand in hand</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge your friends across multiple game modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Golf Mode</strong> \u2013 Sink all the holes before your opponents<br>\ud83c\udfc3 <strong>Race Mode</strong> \u2013 Pass every checkpoint in order as fast as you can<br>\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Capture the Flag</strong> \u2013 Hold the flag to score points and win the match<br>\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Deathmatch Mode</strong> \u2013 Avoid traps and explosions, and outlast your opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Fun, dynamic ball physics<br>\ud83c\udfb1 A unique shot system inspired by croquet<br>\ud83e\udde2 Customize your ball with skins, hats, trails, sounds, and more<br>\ud83c\udf10 Online multiplayer for up to 12 players<br>\ud83c\udf81 <strong>Pick up offensive and defensive power-ups</strong> to cause chaos or protect yourself<br>\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Online leaderboards</strong> to compare your scores with the world (or just your friends)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking for quick fun with friends or fierce competition, <strong>Clubbed</strong> delivers <strong>fast-paced, unpredictable, and endlessly replayable matches</strong>.</p>",
    "short_description": "A chaotic online mini-golf party game where everyone plays at the same time! Simultaneous shots, collisions, multiple game modes, and full ball customization.",
